<div class="postBox">
    <div class="postBoxGrid">
        <div class="postBoxGridLeft">
            <div class="postBoxLeftUpperGrid">
                <div class="memberPostLink"><a href="<%= authorUrl %>"><%= authorName %></a></div>
                <div class="blockAlignCenter"><%- authorPhoto %></div>
                <div class="memberPostGroupLink"><a href="<%= authorGroup.url() %>"><%= authorGroup.getTitle() %></a></div>
                <div>
                    <div class="postBoxInfoItem">
                        <span class="postBoxInfoItemTitle"><%= locale.postEntity.totalPosts %></span>
                        <%- totalPosts %>
                    </div>
                    <% if (pronouns.display) { %>
                        <div class="postBoxInfoItem">
                            <span class="postBoxInfoItemTitle"><%= locale.postEntity.pronouns %></span>
                            <%= pronounContent %>
                        </div>
                    <% } %>
                    <div class="postBoxInfoItem">
                        <span class="postBoxInfoItemTitle"><%= locale.postEntity.reputation %></span>
                        <%= reputation %>
                    </div>
                    <% if (displayJoined) { %>
                        <div class="postBoxInfoItem">
                            <span class="postBoxInfoItemTitle"><%= locale.postEntity.joined %></span>
                            <%- joined %>
                        </div>
                    <% } %>
                    <% if (showLocation) { %>
                        <div class="postBoxInfoItem">
                            <span class="postBoxInfoItemTitle"><%= locale.postEntity.location %></span>
                            <a href="<%= locationUrl %>" target="_blank"><%= location %></a>
                        </div>
                    <% } %>
                    <div class="postBoxInfoItem">
                        <span class="postBoxInfoItemTitle">Gender</span>
                        Male
                    </div>
                    <div class="postBoxInfoItem">
                        <span class="postBoxInfoItemTitle">Age</span>
                        43
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="postBoxGridRight">
            <div class="postBoxRightFlex">
                <div class="postBoxRightTop">
                    <div class="tripleGridCentered">
                        <div class="iconSpace"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days"></i><strong>Posted:</strong> 11/08/2024 07:22 AM</div>
                        <div class="alignCenter"><div class="tagsSmallLink"><span class="tooltip tooltip--top" data-title="<%= locale.topic.tagsTooltip %>"><i class="fa-solid fa-tags"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></span></div></div>
                        <div class="postBoxRightTopRight blockAlignRight">
                            <span><a href="">Post # 1</a></span>
                            <span><a href="javascript:void(0);" class="tooltip tooltip--top" data-title="<%= locale.postEntity.postOptionsTooltip %>"><i class="fa-solid fa-ellipsis-vertical"></i></a></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="postBoxRightCenter">
                    <p>Hey everyone!</p>

                    <p>I just wanted to share my thoughts on the recent changes in the platform. It’s been quite exciting to see the updates, but I do have some concerns about how the navigation flows. I think the new layout looks sleek, but the settings menu feels a bit hidden. Maybe adding some shortcuts or tooltips would help users find them more easily.</p>

                    <p>That being said, I think the improvements in the notifications system are fantastic! Getting real-time updates on topics I follow has definitely made me more engaged. It’s a small thing, but it has made a big difference in my overall experience.</p>

                    <p>Also, I’ve been thinking about the future of the community. As more people join, I believe the focus should shift towards creating spaces for niche topics. It’s great to have broad discussions, but I think we should also create rooms for smaller groups to bond over shared interests. What do you all think about this?</p>

                    <p>Looking forward to hearing your thoughts on these ideas!</p>

                    <p>Cheers,</p>
                    <p>Sam</p>
                    <div class="attachmentsGrid">
                        <div class="attachmentsGridTitle"><i class="fa-solid fa-paperclip"></i>Attachments</div>
                        <div class="attachmentsGridContent">
                            <div class="attachmentItem">
                                <div class="attachmentItemGrid">
                                    <div class="attachmentItemGridTop">sam-picture-1.jpg</div>
                                    <div class="attachmentItemGridCenter">
                                        <div class="attachmentItemGridCenterGrid">
                                            <div class="attachmentItemGridCenterGridLeft"><strong>Size:</strong> 1.2MB</div>
                                            <div class="attachmentItemGridCenterGridRight"><strong>Downloads:</strong> 12.3M</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="attachmentItemGridBottom"><a href="">Download</a></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="attachmentItem">
                                <div class="attachmentItemGrid">
                                    <div class="attachmentItemGridTop">sam-picture-1.jpg</div>
                                    <div class="attachmentItemGridCenter">
                                        <div class="attachmentItemGridCenterGrid">
                                            <div class="attachmentItemGridCenterGridLeft"><strong>Size:</strong> 1.2MB</div>
                                            <div class="attachmentItemGridCenterGridRight"><strong>Downloads:</strong> 12.3M</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="attachmentItemGridBottom"><a href="">Download</a></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="signatureBox">Signature here</div>
                </div>
                <div class="postBoxRightBottom">
                    <div class="dualGridCentered">
                        <div class="postModInfo">
                            <span><strong>IP Address:</strong> 12.32.43.54</span>
                            <span><strong>Hostname:</strong> hostname.com</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="alignRight blockAlignRight">
                            <span class="likeLink">
                                <a href="javascript:void(0);">
                                    <div class="likeLinkGrid">
                                        <div class="likeLinkGridLeft">0</div>
                                        <div class="likeLinkGridRight"><i class="fa-regular fa-thumbs-up"></i>Like</div>
                                    </div>
                                </a>
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>